"settings.getting_started.title" = "Getting Started";
"settings.getting_started.detail" = "A photo can remember more than when it was taken. It can remember where it belongs in a life.";
"settings.overview.title" = "About MemoMark";
"settings.overview.action_detail" = "See why MemoMark begins with time in a person's life.";
"settings.overview.headline" = "Let photos remember where they belong in your life.";
"settings.overview.paragraph_one" = "As children grow, we take many photos. MemoMark began with one question: when you open a photo, can you immediately see how old they were that day?";
"settings.overview.paragraph_two" = "Birthdays, anniversaries, and future milestones can all become Time Anchors. A photo can therefore show not only its capture time, but also an age, a countdown, and its place in a life.";
"settings.overview.paragraph_three" = "MemoMark does not add a watermark. It turns time relationships into memories that are easier to read. Photos stay on your device, and the original always remains unchanged.";
"settings.overview.closing" = "May you enjoy the memories that time has marked.";
